SUMMARY:Caribbean Community Study Circle - by Caribbean Solidarity Network
LOCATION:A Different Booklist
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/Dfx7eFrGliQ/\n\nHosted
  by Caribbean Solidarity Network
  (https://www.caribbeansolidarity.org)\n\nBuilding on last month's
  conversation about racial capitalism\, for this month the reading group
  return to Caribbean thinkers to ground our understanding of the role of
  race in capitalism in material history and conditions of the region\,
  including 'underdevelopment\,' surplus population\, superexploitation\,
  and imperialism.
END:VEVENT
