SUMMARY:Encampment and Equality Rights - by Canadian Civil Liberties
  Association
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://us02web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_T-2Y2MIdQo6Pd5SmuFEaEg#/regis
 tration\n\nHosted by Canadian Civil Liberties Association
  (https://ccla.org/)\n\nLegal experts discuss this year’s decisions in
  Waterloo\, where the Ontario Superior Court found that dismantling an
  encampment would violate residents’ Charter rights\, and in Hamilton\,
  where the Court of Appeal for Ontario ordered a new hearing. Learn what
  these cases mean for equality rights in Canada\, what comes next\, and
  answer questions. 
END:VEVENT
