SUMMARY:Opening Reception for Fighting for Belonging - by Hart House
LOCATION:Hart House
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://harthouse.ca/events/opening-reception-for-fighting-for-belonging\
 n\nHosted by Hart House (https://harthouse.ca)\n\nJoin the Opening
  Reception of Talking Walls\, Fighting for Belonging: The Birth of
  Resistance Culture in Chinatown and Kensington Market. This evening
  offers a closer look at the themes of belonging and activism through the
  work of Community Land Trusts in two of Toronto’s most iconic
