SUMMARY:Civic Meetup #570: Anti-South Asian Racism in Canadian Far-Right
  Digital Networks - by Civic Tech Toronto
LOCATION:available to attendees
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://guild.host/events/civic-meetup-570-invaders-qv0mzd\n\nHosted by
  Civic Tech Toronto (https://civictech.ca/)\n\nHow do Canadian far-right
  groups portray South Asians on social media? Drawing on data collected
  from Canadian far-right networks on X\, the analysis focuses on
  depictions of South Asians as “invaders\,” “polluters\,” and
  “predators\,” and explores how emotions like fear and disgust are
  used​​ to frame South Asians as outsiders and perceived threats to
  Canada.
END:VEVENT
