SUMMARY:Women adapting to the Taliban From Creative Resistance to Digital
  Education - by Science for Peace
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.scienceforpeace.org/events-1/women-adapting-to-the-taliban-fr
 om-creative-resistance-to-digital-education\n\nHosted by Science for Peace
  (https://www.scienceforpeace.org)\n\nMore than five years have passed
  since the Taliban seized control of Afghanistan. Women and girls have
  been subjected to inhumane deprivations of their fundamental right to
  education. In response\, alternative forms of resistance have sprung up\,
  from secret schools to virtual learning. Join Rachel Reid to learn more.
END:VEVENT
